  "name": "Резкий косой удар",
  "prompt": "One single fierce diagonal club strike toward screen right. Briefly coil lower and pull the club back, then explosively lunge the low head and shoulders forward and whip the club down-forward in one broad clear arc. One sharp impact accent, a very short pale motion streak attached to the club head, then a weighted follow-through. The free claw braces near the ground. Short bent legs push, never stand upright. No repeated hits or combo. Recoil and return to the exact starting crouch and original ground position; let the torn cloth settle. Fixed camera, whole body stays inside canvas.",
